    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Reversal trick</span><span class=\"chip accent\">In-place rearrangement</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/rotate-array/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 189</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Rotate Array</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A right rotation by k swaps two blocks: (A B) becomes (B A). Reverse the whole array, then reverse the first k and the last n - k cells, and both blocks come out in order. Take k % n first. O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
